# Demo first (mandatory)

Always send Oscar a **demo** before anything is live.

**Preferred:** spin up a **clickable preview link** (temporary demo site from the feature branch) he can open in a browser. Also attach screenshots/artifacts in the PR.

Until a dedicated demo-hosting system exists, still try to publish a preview URL; if that is impossible, use screenshots + PR walkthrough and say a preview link was not available.

**Do not** push/merge to `main` or make the site live unless he explicitly says:
- "go live", or
- "push", or
- "merge"

Otherwise keep changes on a feature branch + draft PR.

Full policy: `/AGENTS.md` (for Claude and other agents too).
